<td><h2>PNO: Awarded one operated license in APA 2022</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2023-01-10 22:12:31</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Petrolia Noco AS (PNO) is pleased to announce that it has been awarded one operated license by the Norwegian Ministry of Petroleum and Energy under the Awards in Predefined Areas (APA 2022) licensing round. License PL 1181 is located in the northern part of the North Sea and will strengthen the company’s position in its core area in Tampen where it already holds interest in the Dugong discovery and in several adjacent prospective licenses. PNO will hold a 60% working interest in the license.<br> <br>PNO is looking forward to exploring together with license partner Wintershall DEA.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="https://petrolianoco.no/">
