<td><h2>PNO: Departure of MD</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-02-14 13:54:50</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The Board of Directors of Petrolia NOCO AS, today announces the departure of Linn Katrine Høie as the Managing Director of Petrolia NOCO AS. After leading the Company since 2019, Linn Katrine has decided to pursue other opportunities and will leave with immediate effect. Company Chair Robert Arnott will assume an Executive role until a suitable replacement is found.<br><br>The Board of Directors would like to thank Linn for all her efforts in building the organisation and in raising its profile as a collaborative  participant on the NCS. We wish Linn the best of luck in her future endeavours.<br><br>Contact: <br>Executive Chair, Dr Robert Arnott<br>+44 7775 818890, ra@petrolia.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
