<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>CFO Jan Kaspar Gjessing has tendered his resignation. He will remain in his role during the notice period ending 30 April while a replacement is recruited either internally or externally.<br><br>The Board takes the opportunity to wish Mr. Gjessing the best of luck in his future endeavours and to thank him for his valuable contributions.</p></td>
