<td colspan="3"><p>Last year’s Dugong discovery and the high activity planned for this year has resulted in increased attention from the shareholders seeking more information. <br><br>In April an updated Company Presentation was published. <br><br>Today ABG Sundal Collier has started coverage of Petrolia Noco AS as part of a sponsored research agreement, please see link below for the analysis.<br><br>Contact: Jan Kaspar Gjessing, CFO (jkg@petrolia.no)</p></td>
