<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>PNO: Invitation to subscribe for shares in Petrolia Noco AS</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-05-03 12:36:52</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Please find attached invitation to subscribe for shares in Petrolia Noco AS.<br><br>The Invitation is today sent by post to the 100 largest shareholders (14.5% of total 692 shareholders, 99.88% of the shares) as of 30. April 2021.<br><br>Should other existing shareholders want to keep their ownership at the same percentage as prior to the private placement, the largest shareholders have expressed willingness to sell shares at the same price.<br><br>Subscription price is NOK 3.50 per share and subscription deadline is 12 May 2021.</p></td>
