<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to our notice 15 September 2020.<br><br>All formalities have now been completed and 11,812,928 new shares have been issued.<br>Total shares are now 133,300,000.<br>Latest recorded trade was at NOK 2.75.</p></td>
