<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Capital reduction completed</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2019-10-24 08:15:53</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The capital reduction resolved by the AGM on the 13th of June 2019 has now been completed. The par value of the shares has been reduced from NOK 1.00 to NOK 0.10.<br><br>The share capital of the company is NOK 12,148,707.20 divided into 121,487,072 shares, each of par value NOK 0.10.</p></td>
</tr>
