<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2019-08-28 14:54:43</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Please find attached the H1 2019 report of Petrolia NOCO AS.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
